  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 8.1, 'M&E and adaptive management as continual considerations' across the building blocks. The seven foundational building blocks — leadership and governance across the top, above strategy and investment; services and applications; standards and interoperability; infrastructure; legislation, policy and compliance; and workforce — sit inside a dashed cycle. 'Monitoring and evaluation' runs along the top and 'Adaptive Management' along the bottom, with arrows marking a continuous loop between them.",
